2025-12-13 06:23:50,Catalog Update: Verify Product Live and Add Sweets Categories,"1. Greet seller and verify identity. Ask for seller name, company, registered mobile or email, Record ID or GLID. 2. Log in to the IndiaMART Seller Dashboard using your credentials. 3. Go to Catalog > Manage Products. 4. Use Record ID or GLID to locate the exact listing. 5. Search product name keywords like 'tilkut' or 'chikki' if needed. 6. Check Product Status. Confirm whether status shows Active or Inactive. Tell seller the live status. 7. If category is missing, go to Catalog > Categories > Add Category. Add categories such as gud gajak and peanut chikki. 8. To add a new product, click Catalog > Add Product > Fill mandatory fields. Enter product title, select the new category, and link images. 9. Fill product attributes: composition (jaggery/sugar/sesame), variants (white/black sesame), expiry (2–3 months), preservatives (None if applicable), storage instructions (cool dry place), and packaging details. 10. Set price if available or mark as 'Price to be updated'. 11. Set product status to Active and save. Confirm back to the seller that the product and categories are added and live. 12. Review other listings. Flag inactive items and ask seller which to keep active. 13. Provide market search help: tell seller to use dir.indiamart.com and search 'chikki' plus desired Bihar location (Patna, Muzaffarpur, Gaya, etc.). 14. Offer to schedule a field visit or send a field executive for additional product entry help. 15. Upsell: Offer Seller Tools or a promoted listing plan to increase visibility and enquiries.","Seller Dashboard, Catalog, Category, Product Status, Add Product, dir.indiamart.com, tilkut, chikki, gud gajak, peanut chikki, biodegradable plastic bags, Bihar, Expiry, Preservative, Storage",Angry -> Satisfied
