2025-12-13 06:24:32,Catalog Management: Add and Deactivate Products,"1. Verify account and identity. Ask for registered company name and mobile number. Confirm if GST is available. 2. Login to seller portal. Open seller.indiamart.com on desktop mode or install the IndiaMART B2B Marketplace app. Login with your registered mobile number and enter the OTP. 3. If using mobile browser, enable Desktop Site in browser settings. 4. Navigate to product area. Click the three-line menu. Open Seller Tools. Click Manage Product or Products. 5. Add a new product. Click Add Product. Select category. Upload clear photos. Enter title, description, price and GST details. Save the product. 6. Wait for activation. Allow 24 to 48 working hours for account/product activation and publishing. 7. To remove a product, do not delete. Open the specific product. Tap the three-dot menu on the product. Select Deactivate and confirm. 8. Confirm changes and verify product status in Manage Product. 9. Upsell/Value Add: Recommend adding complete product details and GST, and consider IndiaMART promotion services to boost visibility.","catalog, products, seller.indiamart.com, IndiaMART B2B Marketplace app, Seller Tools, Manage Product, Deactivate, GST, OTP login, Srinivas Travel Agency",Angry -> Satisfied
