2025-12-13 06:26:27,Product Listing Images Missing and Upload Failure,"1. Verify caller identity. Ask for business name and registered phone number. Confirm product owner name. 2. Confirm account access. Ask if the caller can open the IndiaMART app and is logged in. Ask if GST is available. 3. Instruct to open app menu. Tap the three horizontal lines in the top-left. 4. Navigate to Seller Tool. Tap Seller Tool. Then tap Manage Product. 5. Open the specific product. Tap Edit on the product you want to update. 6. Add photos. Tap Add Photos. Select images from device and upload. Save changes. 7. Refresh listing view. Close and reopen the app or log out and log in. Wait up to 24 hours if images were uploaded by support. 8. If upload fails, re-upload from your side and ensure each product has 6–8 clear images. 9. Upsell/Value Add: Inform the seller that registering GST enables paid packages to boost visibility, and that improving image count raises the product score to 85–95.","photos, IndiaMART app, Seller Tool, Manage Product, product listing, GST, RK flower, Mohammed Abdul Sheroz",Angry -> Satisfied
