2025-12-13 12:45:43,Catalog Integrity: Unauthorized Edits by Internal Team,"1. Verify your login on the IndiaMART app or Seller Panel. 2. Open Products and review recently modified items. 3. Note unwanted changes like name edits, material changes, or photo removal. 4. Take screenshots of the current view and note the modification date. 5. Go to Support or Help and raise a concern titled 'Unauthorized catalog changes'. 6. Add details: what changed, when it changed, and request restoration to the previous version. 7. Ask to record a note: 'No changes without my explicit approval' and request the design team not to modify or contact without permission. 8. Ask your Account Manager to confirm the action plan and timeline. 9. For better monitoring and lead visibility, consider upgrading to a longer-duration plan.",,Frustrated → Reassured
