2025-12-13 19:27:54,Lead Credit or Reversal Policy Clarification,"1. Verify the registered phone number and seller identity. 2. Ask the seller to open their leads and go to Consumed Byleads. 3. Open the specific bylead. Confirm buyer name, city, date, and quantity. 4. Confirm what the buyer said and note the reason, for example, not their requirement. 5. Clearly state the policy: lead reversal is not available. 6. Record feedback on that bylead and submit it for review. 7. Advise selecting fresh byleads between 0 to 4 hours, with WhatsApp number, mobile number, and email, before consuming. 8. Value-add: Offer a short video meet to review lead selection and follow-up tips for better conversions.","['Lead Reversal Policy', 'Bylead', 'Consumed Leads', 'Feedback submission', 'Fresh bylead (0–4 hours)', 'WhatsApp number and email', 'Requirement mismatch']",Frustrated → Neutral
2025-12-13 19:27:54,Lead Detail Discrepancy in Bylead,"1. Verify the registered phone number and seller identity. 2. Ask the seller to open the same bylead they consumed. 3. Cross-check the lead details on screen, including buyer city and requirement. 4. If the city or details shown differ from what the seller saw, request a screenshot for clarity. 5. Offer a video meet link so the seller can share their screen and show the exact bylead view. 6. Note if it is a direct inquiry or a posted bylead, and document the discrepancy. 7. Submit the discrepancy for review so the bylead can be checked. 8. Value-add: Advise reviewing all specifications and location before consuming fresh byleads, and follow up via WhatsApp for faster response.","['Bylead', 'Lead details mismatch', 'City discrepancy', 'Gorakhpur vs Lucknow', 'Screenshot capture', 'Video meet support', 'Direct inquiry vs posted bylead']",Confused → Clarified
