2025-12-13 19:29:05,Lead Quality Complaint Submission,"1. Verify the seller’s identity and confirm active login. 2. Open the Seller Panel and go to Lead Manager or Byleads. 3. Open each affected lead from recent dates. 4. Use the Dislike or Report option on the lead. 5. Add clear notes: buyer not answering calls, WhatsApp off, and dates of attempts. 6. Submit the complaint to generate a ticket. 7. Share the specific lead details if asked by support for faster review. 8. Keep your phone reachable for the team’s callback on the ticket. 9. For added value, request a call from your Account Manager to review lead quality and optimization tips.","['Lead Manager', 'Byleads', 'dislike/report action', 'ticket creation', 'unresponsive buyers', 'call attempts log', 'Account Manager callback']",Frustrated → Calm
2025-12-13 19:29:58,App Onboarding: Installation and Login Guidance,"1. Verify the caller’s name and relation to the business. 2. Confirm the registered mobile number on the account. 3. Send the official IndiaMART application download link via SMS to that number. 4. Ask the seller to install the IndiaMART application using the same link. 5. Open the IndiaMART application. 6. Log in with the registered mobile number. 7. Confirm the app is open and the login is successful. 8. If there is background noise or poor network, pause guidance and schedule a callback at a specific time. 9. Resume with basic app usage training on the callback. 10. For better visibility and more leads, suggest exploring an upgraded plan after onboarding.","['IndiaMART App', 'App Installation Link via SMS', 'Login with Mobile Number', 'Account Onboarding', 'Training Callback', 'Background Noise', 'Account Manager: Neha Dubey', 'Ankit Garments', 'Noida, Uttar Pradesh']",Confused → Neutral
2025-12-16 17:56:37,Lead Access: Unable to view buyer contact details from inquiry,"1. Confirm the registered mobile number on the account. 2. Ask the seller to log in to the IndiaMART app with that number. 3. On Home, tap Messages. 4. Open the inquiry received via email and review it. 5. If contact details are hidden or a price-to-view is shown, explain that free accounts cannot contact buyers directly. 6. Offer options: complete the on-screen pay-to-view to open details, or upgrade to the paid plan for verified buyleads, direct contacts, and an account manager. 7. Once details are visible, use them to connect with the buyer. 8. For more verified opportunities, consider the paid service for higher lead access.","['IndiaMART application', 'Messages tab', 'Email inquiry', 'Buyer contact details', 'Buyleads', 'Paid Service', 'Verified buyers', 'Dedicated account manager', 'GST registered', 'Aspataal Road Construction', 'Road work', 'Rs 499 pay-to-view']",Neutral → Informed
2025-12-16 17:56:37,Payment assistance for lead unlock or paid service enrollment,"1. Confirm the registered mobile number on the account. 2. Ask the seller to log in to the IndiaMART app with that number. 3. Go to Messages and open the inquiry that shows a price to view buyer details. 4. Tap the pay option and follow the on-screen steps to unlock the details. 5. If a payment issue appears, ask the seller to read the exact error shown on screen. 6. Offer to connect the seller to the paid service team for assisted resolution and plan guidance. 7. Share that upgrading provides verified buyleads and direct contact details for faster conversions.","['Payment issue', 'Pay-to-view', 'Rs 499', 'Buyer contact details', 'Paid Service', 'Verified buyers', 'IndiaMART application', 'Messages tab']",Neutral → Hesitant
