2025-12-17 15:21:21,Profile Photo Upload Guidance,"1. Verify the registered mobile number or email. 2. Ask the seller to log in to the Seller Panel or App. 3. Go to Profile. 4. Tap Edit Profile or Business Photo. 5. Click Upload and select the image. 6. Use a clear face photo or company logo. Keep it well lit and sharp. 7. Save the changes and confirm the photo is visible on the profile. 8. If product images are also needed, go to the Products section, open a product, and add images. 9. For higher trust and visibility, complete all profile fields and consider a paid promotion.","['Profile Photo', 'Product Images', 'Seller Panel', 'Profile Visibility']",Confused → Neutral,1361,3274,4635,0.036143,3.1083
2025-12-17 15:27:47,Lead Visibility: No relevant buyleads displayed,"1. Verify account ownership via the registered mobile number using OTP. 2. Log in to the Seller App or Seller Panel. 3. Go to Leads or BuyLeads. 4. If you see the message 'no relevant buyleads', inform the caller that resolution needs verified account details. 5. If the caller cannot verify, ask them to call from the registered number or provide company GST and full address for verification. 6. Once verified, check the account and share the next steps for lead availability. 7. For stronger lead flow and visibility, consider upgrading to a paid package.","['Buyleads', 'No relevant buyleads', 'Lead visibility', 'Registered mobile number', 'OTP verification', 'GST number', 'Shubham Pharma Technologies']",Confused → Reassured,2332,4343,6675,0.04926,4.2364
